  "entity": "HCMv3.SystemSettings.ManageGeneralSettings",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>General display settings.</p><p>Only the date and time formats are read at present — for dates and times written into emails and generated messages. The rest has no effect.</p><p>There is one settings record per company; it cannot be deleted.</p>",
