      ],
      "rules": "Optional.",
      "when": null,
      "html": "<p><strong>What it is.</strong> The date format used in emails and generated messages.</p><p><strong>Example.</strong> <code>dd/MM/yyyy</code></p><p><strong>Why it matters.</strong> Left blank, <code>dd/MM/yyyy</code> is used. Screens use the user's own language format, not this.</p>",
